            <ArticleTitle>Laparoscopic cyst decompression in polycystic kidney disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>281-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three cases of cyst decompression accomplished laparoscopically in patients had autosomal dominant polycystic kidney disease are reported. The patients experienced a sustained resolution of symptoms after cyst decompression.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
